# mingla-admin Vercel project ignores. Read by Vercel when the project's
# Root Directory is set to `mingla-admin`.
#
# Repo-root .vercelignore handles universal exclusions (other apps, supabase,
# scripts, etc.). This file handles ONLY project-internal cruft.
#
# Established by ORCH-0857 [Vercel .vercelignore project-aware split]
# 2026-05-17. See docs/runbooks/VERCEL_VERCELIGNORE_ARCHITECTURE.md.

node_modules/
.env
.env.local
dist/
.vite/
